namespace Ghul.Pipes is
    /// A sequence that can say how many elements a full read of it would yield,
    /// where that is already settled, without reading anything to find out.
    trait KnownCount is
        /// How many elements a read of the sequence from its start would yield now,
        /// or absent where that isn't known without reading. Never reads the
        /// source, pulls an element or forces a lazy sequence, so asking costs
        /// nothing and changes nothing. A sequence still being filled from its
        /// source, such as a `memo` that hasn't reached the source's end, answers
        /// absent rather than the number of elements it holds so far.
        known_count: int?
    si
si
